 ploads/event/image_36db1efb_20260822141207038154.png
DESCRIPTION:Join Warren County Action in motivating CD7 voters to exercise
  their right and protect our Democracy! We will begin with a short tutoria
 l on how easy phone banking can be\, and end with funny stories of our exp
 erience and pizza! The location will be provided after you register. You'l
 l provide your enthusiasm\, cell phone and laptop. So join us as we get th
 e vote out and have some fun in the process!! WCAT - wcatnj@gmail.com
LOCATION:Washington\, Washington\, NJ\, 07882
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/ionj/event/1015959/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible One NJ (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
