 Hopefully we'll be able to put those skills to the test with actual canvas
 sing. The location will be provided after you register. You'll provide you
 r enthusiasm and cell phone. So join us as we get the vote out and have so
 me fun in the process!! WCAT - wcatnj@gmail.com
LOCATION:Washington\, Washington\, NJ\, 07882
